#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs.rst:4 ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:4
msgid "Jobs"
msgstr "Trabajos"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs.rst:6
msgid ""
"Jobs are for scheduled execution of Automation Tasks and Workflows. Jobs "
"can be set to execute on a schedule, at one specific point in time, "
"and/or execute manually (on-demand). Jobs are linked to existing Tasks or"
" Workflows, and allow for custom configuration options. Jobs can be "
"associated with Instances, Servers, or have no association, such as a job"
" for an SSH task."
msgstr ""
"Jobs son para scheduled ejecución de Automation Tareas y Flujos de trabajo. "
"Jobs puede ser establecer a execute en un schedule, en one specific point "
"en time, y/o execute manually (en-demand). Jobs son linked a existente "
"Tareas o Flujos de trabajo, y permitir para custom configuración opciones. "
"Jobs puede ser associated con Instancias, Servidores, o tienen no "
"association, como un job para un SSH tarea."

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs.rst:8
msgid ""
"Jobs allow for scheduled execution of nearly anything as Tasks Types "
"include Bash, Powershell, HTTP/API, Ansible, Chef, Puppet, Groovy, "
"Python, jRuby, Javascript, and library scripts and templates, which can "
"be configured for resource, remote, or local execution targets. If you "
"need something to execute on a schedule, |morpheus| Jobs can deliver."
msgstr ""
"Jobs permitir para scheduled ejecución de nearly anything as Tareas Tipos "
"incluir Bash, Powershell, HTTP/API, Ansible, Chef, Puppet, Groovy, Python, "
"jRuby, Javascript, y library scripts y plantillas, cual puede ser "
"configurado para recursos, remote, o local ejecución targets. Si you need "
"something a execute en un schedule, |morpheus| Jobs puede deliver."

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs.rst:10
msgid ""
"Jobs are configured in the ``JOBS`` tab, and the ``JOB EXECUTIONS`` tab "
"contains Job execution history with result output."
msgstr ""
"Jobs son configurado en el/la ``JOBS`` pestaña, y el/la ``JOB EXECUTIONS`` "
"pestaña contiene Job ejecución history con resultado output."

